[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6901.91, "timestamp": "01:55:01", "text": "正确的？ Jox 的那个和 OnXia 的那个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6906.629, "timestamp": "01:55:06", "text": "Onexia 和短链接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6908.709, "timestamp": "01:55:08", "text": "OnXA.Link。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6910.709, "timestamp": "01:55:10", "text": "我确实在认真考虑……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6914.79, "timestamp": "01:55:14", "text": "实际上，因为奥妮克西亚，我放弃了其中一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6916.47, "timestamp": "01:55:16", "text": "这东西一点用都没有。这只是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6918.629, "timestamp": "01:55:18", "text": "存档页面，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6926.79, "timestamp": "01:55:26", "text": "我想存钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6929.99, "timestamp": "01:55:29", "text": "我不知道。但它包含了我所有旧的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6932.709, "timestamp": "01:55:32", "text": "这里的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6934.87, "timestamp": "01:55:34", "text": "如果我没记错的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6937.43, "timestamp": "01:55:37", "text": "还有网站相关的内容。我必须使用一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6940.55, "timestamp": "01:55:40", "text": "就像好东西一样。但即使是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6944.229, "timestamp": "01:55:44", "text": "奥妮克希亚。 Onyx 基本上就是我的挚爱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6948.149, "timestamp": "01:55:48", "text": "项目。嗯，更像是一个宇宙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6951.669, "timestamp": "01:55:51", "text": "想要创造一个与众不同的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6953.669, "timestamp": "01:55:53", "text": "不同的角色和一个精彩的故事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6955.589, "timestamp": "01:55:55", "text": "以及一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6959.109, "timestamp": "01:55:59", "text": "嗯，很多类似的事情，我不会。"}]